    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993690/extras/4d32d4a8bd1bbc2b18c4f92ced9c2d84.avif?t=1717458681\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><br>A lone wolf, leading a double life as a gas station worker and for something more criminal...<br>His carefully crafted life is shattered when an encounter with an ordinary customer at the gas station sparks an unexpected connection.<br><br>Will his secrets be unraveled to the world?<br>Join <i><strong>Tyoma</strong></i> as he struggles to navigate his sense of self and find his footing in this world.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2993690/extras/8b454e80b5573ee0046ac461bc7c4366.avif?t=1717458681\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hand-drawn environments and characters<br></li><li>Short experience, ongoing storyline<br></li><li>Branching story paths, with multiple endings<br></li><li>Point and Click exploration with secrets to know more about the game's lore<br></li><li>Art gallery with unlockable images</li></ul>",
